utely! The system will automatically deduct $80, so you'll only pay $220, effectively getting the rod for free. <\/p>"}},"question_7dpAhX":{"type":"question","settings":{"title":"What if I’m unsure of my window measurements? Can I make changes if I order the wrong size?","answer":"<p>We offer free measurement guidance! Contact us at <a href=\"mailto:care@cozyology.com\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"mailto:care@cozyology.com\">care@cozyology.com<\/a>, and you can modify your size for free within 24 hours after placing your order.<\/p>"}},"question_ii9dYV":{"type":"question","settings":{"title":"How long will it take for custom products to ship? Will there be delays due to the sale?","answer":"<p>Ready in 7-9 Business Days. We’ve increased our production capacity by 200% during the sale, so there will be no delays.<\/p>"}},"question_hnFMXq":{"type":"question","settings":{"title":"Can I choose non-lined or non-blackout curtains?","answer":"<p>Yes! We offer various customization options, including unlined and non-blackout curtains. Select the style that suits you best.<\/p>"}},"question_eJRGDK":{"type":"question","settings":{"title":"Can I return or exchange my custom curtains?","answer":"<p>If there is a size discrepancy of more than 1 inch or if we send the wrong color, we will take full responsibility and assist you with the return or exchange. If you have any concerns, feel free to <a href=\"mailto:care@cozyology.com\" title=\"mailto:care@cozyology.com\">contact us<\/a> for assistance.<\/p>"}}},"block_order":["question_7xVf9F","question_8fVCKx","question_7dpAhX","question_ii9dYV","question_hnFMXq","question_eJRGDK"],"disabled":true,"name":"Collapsible tabs","settings":{"title":"FAQ"}},"main":{"type":"main-page","disabled":true,"settings":{"show_page_title":false,"full_width":false}}},"order":["image_with_text_overlay_TYTgWA","compact_messages_4gyNwX","custom_content_9VWbWd","product_list_pUeJaX","custom_content_gLztn4","image_with_text_overlay_U79gNG","rich_text_B8nmYQ